        "text": "Launching High-Quality On-Device Speech That Tops the Benchmarks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "So here's the story of the launch: why we built Phonon, what it can do, the demos that came with it, and how it did on Hugging Face's Open TTS Leaderboard.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Phonon 31m is Apache 2.0, so you can use it for free, even in a commercial product.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Phonon is based on the Pocket TTS lineage and as such uses flow matching to generate the audio which is very different from the modeling techniques used in other TTS systems.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Phonon comes in two sizes, at about 65 MB and 75 MB.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Phonon 31m speaks English and is Apache 2.0, so you can build on it freely, including for commercial products.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Phonon 40m covers all five languages under a non-commercial license.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "An ExecuTorch conversion runs Phonon on a visitor's GPU in the browser, Micdrop brings it to Node.js apps, and Spaces like smallest-s2s build on it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Phonon was downloaded more than 200,000 times in its first two weeks, and it’s still trending on Hugging Face.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With more than 9,000 TTS models on the Hugging Face Hub , the leaderboard gives developers one place to compare open models and hear them side by side.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On intelligibility, Phonon ranks first in German and Spanish , and in the top three in every language we evaluated, next to models up to 100 times its size.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Phonon is also available in 🤗 Transformers, from v5.21, as its reference PyTorch implementation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/phonon-tts",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:50.422Z"
      }
